const packed=["","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],cache=new Map();
export function coastRaster(base){
 let grid=cache.get(base);if(grid)return grid;
 const data=unzlibSync(Uint8Array.from(atob(packed[base]),c=>c.charCodeAt(0)));
 const view=new DataView(data.buffer,data.byteOffset,data.byteLength);grid=new Float32Array(37249);
 for(let i=0;i<grid.length;i++){const v=view.getInt8(i)/127;grid[i]=Math.sign(v)*v*v*120;}
 cache.set(base,grid);return grid;
}
